Date: Tue, 30 Apr 2024 11:14:30 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 0978/1695] drivers: stm32mp2_pmic: handle STPMIC1L and
 STPMIC2L

Handle STPMCI1L and STPMIC2L versions.
- Buck1 can have an extended voltage range that is configured in
NVM at boot time.
- Those pmic can drive external regulators thank's to their GPO.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git e69b46dbd78e5a74df78ff0d224553edc1385cfd drivers: stm32mp2_pmic: handle STPMIC1L and STPMIC2L]
